<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - American Home cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - American Home cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney cut its rating for American Home Products to neutral from buy, a source at the brokerage said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- The drug and food products company's shares were off 1-1/8 to 61-5/8.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
